  "mawaqitWelcome": "A jaɓɓaama e MAWAQIT",
  "mawaqitDesc": "Assalaamu aleykum, yoo moƴƴere Alla won e mon e suɓaade MAWAQIT, laylaytol Ƴoƴngol gadanal kadi woni #1 huutoreede miliyoŋaaji Juulɓe e winndere ndee jeyaaɓe fof e leyɗeele 85+ gila hitaande 2016.\n\nAmin ngaddana on Jaytingol Jamaa Ƴoƴngol ɓurgol yahrude yahrude yeeso, goodngol e kaɓirɗe limtinɗe (Cinnde, Montoor Seŋiiɗo, jaynirɗe Tele), kadi tawa keɓe mon cuuriiɗe ciiɓetaake saka lollinee.\n\nTiiɗnee mballitee ndee eɓɓoore duwanaade ɗoo : https://donate.mawaqit.net\n\nKo min fedde nde ɗaɓɓaani ngalu etee ndee eɓɓoore ko “Waqf fi'sabili Allah” (Dedicated endowment).\n\nDokke mon maa mballu ndee eɓɓoore jokkande mo woni kala, tawa alaa njoɓdi HAY BAƊTE!, tawaa ALAA ƁANNGINOOJE kadi ALAA LULNAGOL lewru.\n\nNdee eɓɓoore waawataano tabitde so wonaano ballal Alla denndinɗo ngoo renndo yarlitiiɓe hatojinnɓe kadi ŋanaaji, gollooɓe jamma e ñalawma ngam addande on nafoore ɓurnde yuɓɓude, kam e kesamhesamaagu sakkitiingu keɓotoongu 24/7.\n\nTiiɗnee ƴeewon rokkude ngam ndee eɓɓoore duwanaade waawa jokkude. Baarak'Allaahu fiikum e ballal mon e hoolaare mom ñiiɓɗe.",
